WEBVTT

1
00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:25.520
The next day Tom went to the picnic.

2
00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:29.980
He didn't bring Cat.

3
00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.300
Tom tried to play games.

4
00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:23.760
But he was still worried about Dirk.

5
00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:30.100
He got some food and sat down.

6
00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:36.548
Suddenly someone sat next to him.

7
00:01:36.549 --> 00:01:37.649
It was Ann!

8
00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:41.390
Tom dropped his plate in surprise.

9
00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:45.050
"I heard you were looking for me," Ann said.

10
00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:47.630
"I was at wizard school yesterday."

11
00:01:48.770 --> 00:01:51.310
Tom picked up his spilled food.

12
00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:55.030
"Why does Dirk hate me?" he asked.

13
00:01:55.513 --> 00:01:58.467
Ann looked sad.

14
00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:01.810
"My father is the head servant," she said.

15
00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:05.030
"But the royal wizard is much more powerful.

16
00:02:05.723 --> 00:02:08.389
This makes Father upset."

17
00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:11.730
"I've got a big problem," Tom said.

18
00:02:12.242 --> 00:02:16.481
He told Ann about Cat.

19
00:02:16.482 --> 00:02:20.417
"Dirk plans to tell everyone about Cat!"

20
00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:24.460
"Father did not like the last royal wizard either," Ann said.

21
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.800
"That wizard put a bad spell on Father.

22
00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:30.980
He made him smell like a cat!

23
00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:34.740
So Father made the queen sneeze too!"

24
00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:36.620
Tom laughed.

25
00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:40.880
"Then the king learned of the spell," Ann said.

26
00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:43.700
"And he fired the royal wizard."

27
00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:49.900
"I'm going to get fired too," Tom said.

28
00:02:50.163 --> 00:02:52.695
"If Dirk tells the king and—"

29
00:02:52.696 --> 00:02:56.702
Ann suddenly jumped up and grabbed Tom's hand.

30
00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:59.540
"I just remembered something!" she said.

31
00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:01.180
"Come with me!"
